## Why This Is Asked
This question assesses mastery of modern CSS techniques including CSS Grid, container queries, responsive design principles, and accessibility considerations for real-world product interfaces.

## Key Concepts
- CSS Grid layout with auto-sizing columns
- Container queries for container-based responsiveness
- Equal-height card layouts using grid alignment
- Motion preferences and performance optimization
- Content Layout Shift (CLS) prevention during resize operations

## Code Example
